  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kashaka Cheese Processing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Infrastructure development for the cheese Industry: Construction of the Cheese Processing Building, which will have internal dimensions of 35 meters long by 12 meters wide, and acquiring the processing equipment for cheese.Training Dairy cooperative members on all matters that directly contribute to milk quality and milk productivity at farm level and ensure high milk grade which will fetch premium price for the members thus increased revenues.The crop finance. The crop finance will increase the working capital of the cooperative, thus providing ready market for the farmers&apos; produce, sustained income to farmers and increase in the production volume</narrative>
  </description>
